    # n "{size=-10}...too small..."
    n "{size=-10}...zu klein..."

# game/script.rpy:1125
translate german ending_d_3ef7bbae:

    # "Ending (2/3): It wasn't melatonin"
    "Ende (2/3): Kein Melatonin"

# game/script.rpy:1135
translate german ending_e_213253f2:

    # d "Okay, well, how about you stay over at my place tonight? It's about time you tried sleeping in a normal bed again."
    d "Nun, gut, wie wär's, wenn heute Nacht bei mir schläfst? Es wird Zeit, dass du mal wieder in einem normalen Bett schläfst."

# game/script.rpy:1136
translate german ending_e_b9c2962c:

    # d "We can play pong. Or I can show you some shit I wrote for the band. C'mon, you haven't been over in forever."
    d "Wir können Pong zocken. Oder ich zeige dir den Scheiß, den ich für die Band geschrieben habe. Komm schon."

# game/script.rpy:1149
translate german ending_e_106ed66a:

    # text "You do kind of miss hanging out in Dimitri's room."
    text "Du vermisst schon irgendwie in Dimitris Zimmer abzuhängen."

# game/script.rpy:1150
translate german ending_e_eea2fd04:

    # text "You didn't like interacting with his family so you'd always climb up and get in through his window on the second floor."
    text "Du mochtest es nicht, mit seiner Familie zu reden, also bist du immer durch das Fenster, im 1. Stock, geklettert."

# game/script.rpy:1151
translate german ending_e_6adbaa43:

    # text "He hated it."
    text "Er hat es gehasst."

# game/script.rpy:1162
translate german ending_e_62358232:

    # n "Fine, I'll stay over."
    n "Gut, ich komme mit zu dir."

# game/script.rpy:1167
translate german ending_e_df917d0b:

    # d "Right on."
    d "Alles klar."

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate german ending_e_49c6763a:

    # n "Ugh, that sucked."
    n "Urks, das war scheiße."

# game/script.rpy:1188
translate german ending_e_4c7bcd23:

    # n "I can't believe we ate the wall pizza too."
    n "Ich kann nicht glauben, dass wir die Wandpizza gegessen haben."

# game/script.rpy:1190
translate german ending_e_201af05a:

    # d "I can't stand the sight of wasting food! I hate when my siblings do it."
    d "Ich ertrage den Anblick von weggeschmissenem Essen nicht! Ich hasse es, wenn meine Geschwister das tun."

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate german ending_e_8a8fe5a6:

    # n "There were DEAD FLIES on the wall, dude. Stuck there with thousand-year-old grease."
    n "Es waren TOTE FLIEGEN an der Wand, Alter. Die an tausend Jahre altem Fett klebten."

# game/script.rpy:1205
translate german ending_e_de87c1dc:

    # d "You practically live in the woods; I'm sure you've eaten worse."
    d "Du lebst so gesehen im Wald. Sicherlich hast du schon Schlimmeres gegessen."

# game/script.rpy:1209
translate german ending_e_f39a7c58:

    # n "You're right."
    n "Hast Recht."

# game/script.rpy:1213
translate german ending_e_577456db:

    # n "I've had Momo's food."
    n "Momos Essen."

# game/script.rpy:1214
translate german ending_e_5c04bf35:

    # n "I swear the only things she knows how to make are pregnancy cravings."
    n "Ich schwöre, das einzige was sie machen kann, sind irgendwelche Schwangerschaftsgelüste."

# game/script.rpy:1218
translate german ending_e_331609bd:

    # d "You're not wrong on that front."
    d "Du hast nicht ganz Unrecht."

# game/script.rpy:1219
translate german ending_e_0e30a25e:

    # d "Here, listen to this song I wrote about Juno."
    d "Hier, hör dir das Lied an, das ich über Juno geschrieben habe."

# game/script.rpy:1220
translate german ending_e_3496871d:

    # d "I'm gonna pitch it to the band this Friday. Tell me if it sucks ass."
    d "Ich zeige es der Band am Freitag. Sag mir, ob es beschissen ist."

# game/script.rpy:1230
translate german ending_e_c3babbba:

    # text "Dimitri's room is where you fell in love with music."
    text "In Dimitris Zimmer hast du dich in die Musik verliebt."

# game/script.rpy:1231
translate german ending_e_38c5d1c7:

    # text "The days spent listening to whiny vocalists and shitty distorted guitar while doing homework. It was a miracle you even got any assignments done."
    text "Die Tage, die ihr verbracht habt, kläglichen Sängern und verzerrten Gitarren beim Hausaufgabenmachen zuzuhören. Ein Wunder, dass ihr was geschafft habt."

# game/script.rpy:1232
translate german ending_e_4302c029:

    # text "Eventually, you and a couple of Dimitri's other friends formed a crappy little garage band called 'My Life is a Shitshow and I Can't Wipe Away the Stains', and now you're playing at some guy's basement in a couple of weeks."
    text "Irgendwann haben du und Dimitris Freunde, eine Band gegründet, dir ihr 'Mein Leben ist 'ne Scheißshow und ich kann die Flecken nicht beseitigen' genannt habt und nun spielt ihr bald bei irgendeinem Typen."

# game/script.rpy:1233
translate german ending_e_142c8a1a:

    # text "They all roped you into doing vocals because you were good at yelling or whatever, which is apparently good for punk."
    text "Sie haben dich überredet zu singen, weil du gut darin warst, zu schreien oder so, was scheinbar gut für Punk ist."

# game/script.rpy:1238
translate german ending_e_93175a63:

    # text "You were reluctant at first, claiming that you were only there for the free sodas, but now this shitty little garage band is the only time you ever feel like you're wanted."
    text "Du hast dich erst geweigert, meintest du wärst nur für die kostenlose Limo da, aber jetzt ist diese Garagenband das einzige Mal, dass du dich gebraucht fühlst."

# game/script.rpy:1240
translate german ending_e_c7834743:

    # text "If only summer didn't end. Then things could remain exactly how they are, and how they used to be."
    text "Wenn der Sommer einfach nie enden würde. Dann könnten die Dinge so bleiben wie sie sind und wie sie waren."

# game/script.rpy:1245
translate german ending_e_4e911b86:

    # text "Thankfully, Dimitri's room hasn't changed one bit."
    text "Zum Glück ist Dimitris Zimmer gleich geblieben."

# game/script.rpy:1251
translate german ending_e_00e71d89:

    # text "You look around the room and your eyes land on Dimitri's {i}Snailman and Slime Frog{/i} poster."
    text "Du schaust dich um, und siehst dir Dimitris {i}Schneckenmann und Schleimfrosch{/i} Poster an"

# game/script.rpy:1252
translate german ending_e_e5e5b989:

    # text "That nerd."
    text "Dieser Nerd."

# game/script.rpy:1253
translate german ending_e_8e6a550e:

    # text "That poster is probably at least 11 years old."
    text "Das Poster ist bestimmt mindestens 11 Jahre alt."

# game/script.rpy:1254
translate german ending_e_bd6e6cb9:

    # text "Dimitri was the one who introduced you to the show, and you remember following him home every day after school to watch the new episode."
    text "Dimitri war der, der dir die Serie zeigte und du erinnerst dich, wie du jeden Tag nach der Schule mit ihm gegangen bist, um die neue Folge zu schauen."

# game/script.rpy:1260
translate german ending_e_2746d17d:

    # text "There's the lighter you gave him in tenth grade."
    text "Da ist das Feuerzeug, das zu ihm in der 10. gegeben hast."

# game/script.rpy:1264
translate german ending_e_1f5b6af2:

    # text "The stop sign you toppled over when Dimitri let you take Juno for a spin."
    text "Das Stoppschild, das du umgefahren hast, als du mit Juno eine Spritztour gemacht hast."

# game/script.rpy:1266
translate german ending_e_f3b499b8:

    # text "Never again."
    text "Nie wieder."

# game/script.rpy:1272
translate german ending_e_4843faef:

    # text "He even kept the cool stick you found in the woods."
    text "Er hat sogar noch den coolen Stock, den du gefunden hattest."

# game/script.rpy:1274
translate german ending_e_bcb4b40d:

    # text "Why did he tape it up like that..."
    text "Warum hat er den an die Wand geklebt..."

# game/script.rpy:1279
translate german ending_e_d4b63651:

    # text "Oh."
    text "Oh."

# game/script.rpy:1284
translate german ending_e_9b20f5a8:

    # text "Man, your head WAS big."
    text "Mann, dein Schädel WAR groß."

# game/script.rpy:1293
translate german ending_e_9e3cc995:

    # n "When are you leaving?"
    n "Wann gehst du?"

# game/script.rpy:1299
translate german ending_e_27314237:

    # d "For uni? The 27th."
    d "Zur Uni? Am 27ten."

# game/script.rpy:1303
translate german ending_e_facc5c5d:

    # n "I see."
    n "Ach so."

# game/script.rpy:1307
translate german ending_e_cb02081c:

    # d "Dude, don't worry 'bout that right now. We still have plenty of summer left."
    d "Alter, mach dir keine Gedanken darüber. Der Sommer ist noch lang."

# game/script.rpy:1310
translate german ending_e_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "..."

# game/script.rpy:1313
translate german ending_e_59c8cd84:

    # d "Tell you what. I don't know what the future's gonna look like, but let's make this the best summer of our lives."
    d "Ich weiß nicht, wie die Zukunft aussieht, aber lass uns das zum besten Sommer unseres Lebens machen."

# game/script.rpy:1322
translate german ending_e_4ebd3239:

    # d "You wanna go fishing at Lost Lake?"
    d "Du willst am Lost Lake angeln?"

# game/script.rpy:1323
translate german ending_e_2249c16d:

    # d "I'll grab my finest tackle."
    d "Ich schnapp' mir meine feinste Angel."

# game/script.rpy:1328
translate german ending_e_356327b5:

    # d "Wanna grab 2AM slushies?"
    d "Ein Slush, um 2 Uhr Morgens?"

# game/script.rpy:1329
translate german ending_e_9a32460d:

    # d "I'll meet you at the Junkie's parking lot 5, even 10 minutes early."
    d "Ich treffe dich an Junkies Parkgarage 5, sogar 10 Minuten früher."

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate german ending_e_6010fced:

    # d "Wanna get high and play Pong at my house?"
    d "Willst high sein und in meinem Haus Pong zocken?"

# game/script.rpy:1334
translate german ending_e_131793ee:

    # d "I'll be here. Just call me."
    d "Ich bin hier. Ruf mich einfach an."

# game/script.rpy:1340
translate german ending_e_5fa6fd40:

    # d "But for now- please, just shut the fuck up and get some sleep."
    d "Aber jetzt- bitte, halt dein Maul und schlaf erstmal."

# game/script.rpy:1346
translate german ending_e_e182ea20:

    # n "Okay, okay, jeez."
    n "Okay, okay, Mensch."

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate german ending_e_1f179f93:

    # text "Your last summer together, before everything changes."
    text "Euer letzter gemeinsamer Sommer, bevor sich alles ändert."

# game/script.rpy:1352
translate german ending_e_ea9a37ff:

    # text "You take in the droning sound of Dimitri's guitar playing, this precious snapshot that you know will be no more in a couple months' time."
    text "Du genießt das Geräusch von Dimitris Gitarrenspiel, dieser kostbare Schnappschuss, der in ein paar Monaten nicht mehr da sein wird. "

# game/script.rpy:1356
translate german ending_e_70b25dad:

    # text "However, at this exact moment, things are exactly how they used to be."
    text "Jedoch, genau in diesem Moment, sind die Dinge, wie sie waren."

# game/script.rpy:1360
translate german ending_e_a2c1d617:

    # text "And for the first time in about a week, the sense of dread that's been following you around is not there."
    text "Und das erste Mal seit einer Wochen, ist die dröhnende Furcht, die dich verfolgte, nicht mehr da."

# game/script.rpy:1361
translate german ending_e_5d0b865f:

    # text "Slowly, you finally drift to sleep."
    text "Langsam schläfst du endlich ein."

# game/script.rpy:1367
translate german ending_e_92b66696:

    # "Ending (3/3): Good night"
    "Ende (3/3): Gute Nacht"

